# The champion with heavier fists: waves wait for forty units.
#
# The other surviving lever from the Impossible autopsy (log 2026-07-30): the
# champion feeds 25-unit waves into turret lines the same way the rush fed
# 3-tank ones, just later. The wave ladder was tuned against Medium income;
# against a compounding economy the question is whether fewer, heavier
# punches convert where a stream does not.

name aa-counter-guard-mass40
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 40
